\section*{What Works}

\begin{tcolorbox}[colback=success,colframe=green!50!black,
top=0.5mm,bottom=0.5mm,left=2mm,right=2mm]
\raggedright
\begin{itemize}
\item Story-led curriculum — narrative over lectures
\item \textbf{Watch $\rightarrow$ Learn $\rightarrow$ Ace} framework
\item Strong visual and animated explanations
\item Teacher credibility: profiles, philosophy, chapter ownership
\item 24/7 AI doubt support
\item ALLEN's 35+ year legacy and brand trust
\end{itemize}
\end{tcolorbox}

\vspace{1mm}

\section*{What Doesn't Work}

\begin{tcolorbox}[colback=danger,colframe=red,
top=0.5mm,bottom=0.5mm,left=2mm,right=2mm]
\raggedright
\textbf{Selling Starts Before Learning}

\vspace{0.5mm}
Enrollment prompts surface within minutes — before meaningful learning. Urgency before trust makes commitment feel premature.

\vspace{1mm}
\textbf{Language Creates Friction}

\vspace{0.5mm}
Chapters are English-first. Students who learn best in Hindi, Telugu, Tamil or Marathi hit a comprehension wall before they reach the value.
\end{tcolorbox}

\vspace{1.5mm}

